直接打印数组：[I@36baf30c
Arrays.toString：[5, 3, 8, 1, 9, 2]
sort 之后：[1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 9]
binarySearch(8) = 4
binarySearch(7) = -5
binarySearch(0) = -1
binarySearch(100) = -7
fill 全部填充：[7, 7, 7, 7, 7]
fill 指定区间填充：[7, 0, 0, 7, 7]
c == d 的结果：false
Arrays.equals(c, d) 的结果：true
copyOf 扩容：[1, 2, 3, 0, 0]
